            <div xml:id="m-2612e60b-80de-42b7-a097-36aa4b812ee0">
              <lg xml:id="m-5f3aa589-086b-4ad4-96a5-dead589f2d71">
                <l xml:id="m-935929b6-e94c-4e1d-8367-18ca4ae8d6ab" facs="#m-7ed92051-4778-4a9f-849d-7fb35e67aa0f" label="text-like">Common of a Confessor Bishop. At None.</l><l xml:id="m-053f31e4-5580-491c-8be5-f25619748cdb" facs="#m-d020abf3-5789-4ebf-b628-2ad042c23509" label="ambiguous">1175</l><l xml:id="m-fb04af3f-047d-4503-8f8e-b33f5492906a" facs="#m-bc8c2f2d-ccdc-4403-bcdc-1c2bf222d5f8" label="lyrics-like">sacri-fi-cándum é-i hósti-am láudis. Gló-ri-a Pátri.</l><l xml:id="m-77286ebc-05c0-4f0d-892c-4e7640541658" facs="#m-589b2c0a-7d5a-4fae-a5a4-6cf8b3bb27f4" label="text-like">In Paschal Time.</l><l xml:id="m-2ab698eb-a591-424e-8fbf-708fb833c01b" facs="#m-73b9b4dd-08f8-4c6b-a36f-2cb2d54c2036" label="ambiguous">Short</l><l xml:id="m-b500aa06-1970-4323-96b7-3ad746253922" facs="#m-9137db80-2310-4225-b0f5-c03fe498a042" label="ambiguous">Resp.</l><l xml:id="m-fd130b62-e607-45c4-85cd-cee15742c28b" facs="#m-3a13f82d-0192-4823-9c54-706beba232f0" label="lyrics-like">-légit é-um Dóminus sacerdó-tem síbi: “Alle¬</l><l xml:id="m-24391221-8c75-4dc5-84a1-4bae6430f265" facs="#m-e8aae179-3ed7-4934-bd3f-8a55830fe47c" label="lyrics-like">lú-ia, alle-lú-ia. V. Ad sacri-fi-cándum é-i hósti-am láu¬</l><l xml:id="m-bd12e3c8-9279-4868-8ba4-24ce667229c6" facs="#m-acc96ec3-8859-4ae2-be2a-af5461a02003" label="lyrics-like">dis. Gló-ri-a Pátri.</l><l xml:id="m-0e5f9ff7-8b21-4217-a4eb-21198b5d251a" facs="#m-ad37f59f-c884-4151-a522-051534617ed7" label="lyrics-like">V. Tu es sacérdos in aetérnum. (T. P. Allelúia.)</l><l xml:id="m-b1ef1f26-b531-4171-9292-b2ce7855b882" facs="#m-eeb7e840-35b7-4506-9af3-001ca3b07af0" label="lyrics-like">F. Secúndum órdinem Melchísedech. (T. P. Allelúia.)</l><l xml:id="m-59688b8c-53d7-4ded-97c0-6c6bff216ece" facs="#m-71ad2a30-6cc1-4e7a-9fb6-9a87c30f84ae" label="text-like">AT NONE.</l><l xml:id="m-d1f9e968-4f9e-4e51-9d4b-201ec9533887" facs="#m-fbe59c13-5898-4c19-8a7d-9fc9395ff405" label="lyrics-like">Ant. Sérve bóne. p. 1177. Psalms of Sunday.</l><l xml:id="m-7d5b916f-4309-4d7e-9da9-a4a402ed5505" facs="#m-1731ea0d-0925-44ed-8e1a-0eda780a1fae" label="ambiguous">Eccli. 45. c.</l><l xml:id="m-484d0363-9386-446e-be13-9e0c924bdbef" facs="#m-cac52876-8033-473e-86c3-a4aa599d134a" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-ba84ad64-8bd0-46c3-97fb-e371edb29cac" facs="#m-0068f73b-5ce3-46be-a2ed-7a290a46ed01" label="lyrics-like">yUngi sacerdótio, t et habére offérre illi incénsum dignum in odó¬</l><l xml:id="m-567fb7f7-84d2-4324-b8fa-9d10628fd5e7" facs="#m-a3887268-eead-4f72-8df2-e3fbfabf6380" label="lyrics-like">laudem in nómine ipsius, et rem suavitátis.</l><l xml:id="m-714cdf2b-e5e2-409e-ae3f-93d0ffc86afc" facs="#m-3f76f4d5-9ba5-4a5f-bfb2-ef4bfd8bdd71" label="ambiguous">short</l><l xml:id="m-9be3def3-6993-4f36-8f5d-2cafaae3a9ef" facs="#m-7d1b1cfd-86e9-4e69-a296-f2cc1d8509fc" label="ambiguous">Resp.</l><l xml:id="m-f30c75fd-d107-470d-87c4-7b209e98cdc9" facs="#m-5dd2473d-a32d-45a8-9f9c-2adb41d9a604" label="lyrics-like">U es sacérdos“ In aetérnum. V. Se-cúndum órdi¬</l><l xml:id="m-071e0e7a-64bd-45b4-8bed-db5ad4309e78" facs="#m-4ed9b4f8-f993-497e-8665-06eedf4f5e1b" label="lyrics-like">nem Melchí-sedech. Gló-ri-a Pátri.</l><l xml:id="m-7ded3f0a-0b8e-429d-9d3e-4fcb712c2024" facs="#m-6ea5e956-2091-4774-90d1-52a5c702e7d8" label="text-like">In Paschal Time.</l><l xml:id="m-6b70a602-fed6-47d1-a88a-75a66bf6734d" facs="#m-b81fe9d3-418c-486b-8742-b3fdbe3945b8" label="ambiguous">Short</l><l xml:id="m-c57b0a1a-fb0a-4a76-8d7e-23660cbd10e8" facs="#m-7ced23c0-06fc-4e55-a0b2-0ae5a0c4cc6e" label="ambiguous">Resp.</l><l xml:id="m-2e53085d-a529-415a-906c-4ef118969e69" facs="#m-2e2977e2-b220-4ffa-a130-bca52a88dd3c" label="lyrics-like">U es sacérdos in aetérnum :“Alle-lú-ia, alle-lú-ia.</l><l xml:id="m-d208918c-80b7-4481-b39c-f2344329cd0a" facs="#m-0df538ae-eb52-47a6-a7fa-0178ad7db820" label="lyrics-like">V. Secúndum órdinem Melchi-sedech. Gló-ri-a Pátri.</l><l xml:id="m-f40585d7-1df1-432b-b123-ba3460c9015c" facs="#m-b88352da-5535-4179-823b-ed8e84629e3d" label="lyrics-like">v. Jústum dedúxit Dóminus per vías réctas. (T.P. Allelúia.)</l><l xml:id="m-2d3c2f9f-438f-4e92-8351-26d177e25d79" facs="#m-14aba3fd-7c87-4490-94ff-7738d52c3662" label="lyrics-like">K. Et osténdit illi régnum Déi. (T. P. Alleluia.)</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>